; The Windows DLL export list. A name here MUST exist in the library: the linker resolves every
; export, so a stale entry is a hard link failure and only on Windows/macOS -- a Linux .so links
; with undefined symbols and says nothing. That is why three visualisation exports survived the
; viz split (board #18) unnoticed until the release matrix was actually built.
EXPORTS
performRewriting
WolframLibrary_initialize
WolframLibrary_uninitialize